[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 27911.27, "timestamp": "07:45:11", "text": "這有點麻煩，因為每個 PE 用戶都必須手動設定自己的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 27919.468, "timestamp": "07:45:19", "text": "時區。但是，宇宙中的一切，包括時間，都將預設為"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 27926.548, "timestamp": "07:45:26", "text": "印度標準時間 (IST)。所以，"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 27944.792, "timestamp": "07:45:44", "author": "@Ninja477", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/DgHpXlaDuDSPk2w40fljKZE0ZpWffCKDHKYfP2DNO6YWP5QEr5mBRcLrJDjF8KH0euY0GnYAF6c=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "i want the time system you follow"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 27946.07, "timestamp": "07:45:46", "text": "它會根據我的時區向人們問好。例如，如果我沒記錯的話，Candy Sun 是美國品牌，對吧？所以如果我沒記錯的話，嗯，是的，那麼現在對我們來說是晚上，對吧？所以它會這樣說「晚上好，糖果」。您"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 27955.23, "timestamp": "07:45:55", "text": "想要那種自動系統，還是想要手動"}]